Package: meta3level
Type: Package
Title: Automated Multilevel and Conventional Meta-Analysis Workflows
Version: 0.6.2.9000
Authors@R: person("awardtome", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "awardtome@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Provides reproducible workflows for three-level and conventional
    random-effects meta-analysis. It pools dependent effects by study when a
    conventional model is requested, prepares correlations, odds ratios, and
    standardized mean differences, fits models with small-sample F tests,
    decomposes heterogeneity, evaluates continuous, categorical, and spline
    moderators, performs publication-bias diagnostics, and runs leave-one-out
    sensitivity analyses.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    metafor,
    splines,
    stats,
    utils,
    graphics,
    tools
